        "uuid": "4d69cd85_0340f57c",
        "filename": "system/bta/include/bta_ras_api.h",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 40,
      "author": {
        "id": 1583276
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-10-07T18:52:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "hmm..., the RAS is cached for now. so the safe way is to initialize the tracker once the GATT(ACL) is connected. I\u0027m trying to find an entry point to initialize, but it seems no good way except the ACL connection event(I had a concern as the event happens for each ACL, and the CS measurement may never happen.), any other suggestions?",
      "parentUuid": "232f1b71_ccd6496e",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 40,
        "startChar": 15,
        "endLine": 40,
        "endChar": 40
      },
      "revId": "c6b39608c7a419c6df652f1c22c9fcb9f8f466f4",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
